# 社交网站：推特X / Facebook / Instagram
# Quantumult X 原生规则；资源解析器关闭。
# 每个 App 使用独立策略组；此资源的“策略偏好”关闭。

# 推特X
host-suffix, x.com, 推特X
host-suffix, twitter.com, 推特X
host-suffix, twimg.com, 推特X
host-suffix, t.co, 推特X

# Facebook
host-suffix, facebook.com, Facebook
host-suffix, facebook.net, Facebook
host-suffix, fbcdn.net, Facebook
host-suffix, fbsbx.com, Facebook

# Instagram
host-suffix, instagram.com, Instagram
host-suffix, cdninstagram.com, Instagram
